                    Dominican Republic, 9/77–6/78. No classification marking.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d233-f2" n="2" xml:id="d233-f2-content">
                <p>In a May 31 reply to Carter, Guzman
                    expressed his gratitude for Carter’s letter. (Carter Library, National Security
                    Affairs, Brzezinski Material, President’s Correspondence with Foreign Leaders
                    File, Box 5, Folder: Dominican Republic: President Antonio Guzman,
                    8/77–11/79)</p>
            </note>
